---
interface Props { headingLevel?: 'h3' | 'h4'; }
const { headingLevel: Heading = 'h3' } = Astro.props;
---

<div class="monitoring-agent-example">
    <div>
        <Heading class="monitoring-agent-example__title">From production evidence<br />to a verified fix.</Heading>
        <p>Your agent can investigate the failure as it happened, instead of guessing from the state your product is in now.</p>
        <p>It can turn that evidence into a failing test, then use the test to verify its fix. The same test helps prevent the problem from returning.</p>
    </div>
    <figure class="monitoring-context-card">
        <figcaption>Payment confirmation fails <span>Failure report</span></figcaption>
        <dl class="monitoring-context-card__facts">
            <div><dt>First seen in</dt><dd>Payments v1.8.4</dd></div>
            <div><dt>Occurrences</dt><dd>37</dd></div>
            <div><dt>Affected model</dt><dd>reservation-1042</dd></div>
        </dl>
        <h4>What happened</h4>
        <pre><code>{`POST /api/reservations
  → ReserveTicket
    → StartPayment
      → PaymentProviderTimeout`}</code></pre>
        <dl class="monitoring-context-card__facts monitoring-context-card__state">
            <div><dt>State at failure</dt><dd>Awaiting payment</dd></div>
        </dl>
    </figure>
</div>
